    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Content Brief + Validation\nFill in title/topic/keyPoints here.\n\"Brief Filled In?\" stops the run with a Slack alert instead of letting placeholder text silently flow into the agents (this is what broke the previous version).",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b5a2bdfa-b232-4fac-a652-d1746c480101",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Brief",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [96, 592]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Agent Chain\nResearch, Fact Check, and SEO agents use Structured Output Parsers - they return real parsed JSON fields, not free text that has to be JSON.parse()'d downstream (the old design silently produced nulls when that parse failed).\nWriter and Editor stay as free-text Markdown agents.\nA validation gate follows Research and SEO output to catch failures early instead of letting them cascade through the whole chain.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "d7dd54de-55db-4728-aad1-1abbe2cbf22d",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Agent Chain",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1600, 592]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Real Human-in-the-Loop Gate\n\"Send for Approval\" uses Slack Send-and-Wait: the workflow genuinely pauses here until a human clicks Approve/Reject in Slack. Nothing runs downstream until then - this replaces the old design where \"approval\" was just a notification with no actual gate.\nRequires: Interactivity enabled on your Slack app + Request URL set to your n8n instance (see n8n docs \"Approvals in Slack\"). Verify the exact output field name (this uses $json.approved) against a real test run in your instance, since it can vary by n8n version.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "b13cb021-1a76-4ef4-b41a-8d8b3fa1c0ac",
      "name": "Sticky Note: HITL Gate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [2880, 448]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Publish\nOnly reachable after explicit human approval.\nFill in: Slack channel ID (all Slack nodes), Hashnode \"Hashnode API Token\" credential (HTTP Header Auth, header \"Authorization\", value \"Bearer <PAT>\"), and publicationId in the request body.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "db4fb40c-66ef-4fdf-a297-f1d2bd982e1b",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Publish",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [3424, 288]
    }
